Z||000000||2xsess||02-23-2001||02:52 PM||||Was scanning through ebay and saw this, <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=563442634&r=0&t=0" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=563442634&r=0&t=0</A> <P>Thought is was all good until I reread the mileage, they have a starting bid of $8995 for a 144,000 mile Indy???!!!??? unless it's one of the true Indy pace cars I think they're expecting a little much.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">      <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroLisa||02-23-2001||03:43 PM||||I agree!! He's either mis-informed or hoping for a buyer who is.<P>I guess if it was the 2.7L Pace Car it might be worth that much, but at 144K miles?<BR>Can't blame him for trying to get the money though, I didn't think I'd sell my coupe for my asking price of $2300 but I did!<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pffsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
